# VERIFY — {{PROJECT}}

Changes made but not yet verifiable (gated on a deploy, real data, a time
window, hardware, or the owner). Each entry: what changed, how to verify,
acceptance criteria. Drain via `/verify`; delete entries once confirmed;
surprises → GOTCHAS.md. Open entries use `- [ ]` — session_boot counts them.

<!-- Entry format (newest first; pattern quoted mid-line so session_boot's
